<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - SAfrica May manufacturing prod up 2.6pct y/y.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SAfrica May manufacturing prod up 2.6pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production rose 2.6 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in May compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was down 4.9 percent.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 May '97	 Apr '97	May '96</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  107.6	   113.1	  104.9</p>
<p>    Actual		   108.6	   106.0	  105.5</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
